# Product Image Enrichment System — TODO

## Project Goal

Build a production-ready product image enrichment pipeline that:

```text
Excel
  ↓
Product Import
  ↓
Find Products Without Images
  ↓
Search for Candidate Images
  ↓
Score / Validate Images
  ↓
Upload to Cloudinary
  ↓
Store Image Reference in PostgreSQL
  ↓
Connect Images to Products
  ↓
Display Images in Next.js Storefront
```

### MVP Milestone

Do **not** start by processing the entire product catalog.

First prove that the system can:

> Given one product, reliably find, validate, upload, and associate one correct image.

Then expand to 10 products → 50 products → full catalog.

---

