## Task 16 — Implement Confidence Scoring

Create:

```typescript
calculateConfidence(product, candidate);
```

Suggested scoring model:

```text
Brand match          +30
Product name match   +25
Model match          +25
Category match       +10
Image quality         +5
Trusted source        +5
-----------------------------
Maximum              100
```

- [ ] Implement scoring
- [ ] Return score from `0–100`
- [ ] Add unit tests
- [ ] Test correct matches
- [ ] Test incorrect matches
- [ ] Test partial matches

---

## Task 17 — Implement Confidence Threshold

